Demonstrate a connected material-preparation, characterization, and property investigation (@metal-laboratory-project: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @metals-and-metallurgical-production, #source "../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F", #source "../sources/Rockwell-Hardness-Measurement-NIST.lingua#r_00QNYTS0KD4Y8SCJR68K1JECFM", #source "../sources/Charpy-Impact-Uncertainty-NIST.lingua#r_5GBY4J4HZTHJSY48TSH3RZ0MZR", #source "../sources/ASM-Metallography-and-Microstructures.lingua#r_4XHEJ1ZHW0B1YNG9AWCEC491ME", #source "../sources/ASM-Mechanical-Testing-and-Evaluation.lingua#r_1VW327STC5YQGRAPNRAPQSZQNG", #metals-and-metallurgical-production "Advanced-pyro-hydro-and-electrochemical-process-study.lingua#r_68RRFAQE1TM4FPRKRBJESZ4NRP") { r_09J2YXY9CYN5B0VVFQZ7XTAXPK
**Read:** [Metals, alloys, steels, and graduate modeling — Bhadeshia teaching materials](../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F), the complete preparation, observation, experiment, quantitative, and alloy-specific work used; [Rockwell Hardness Measurement of Metallic Materials — Samuel R. Low, NIST](../sources/Rockwell-Hardness-Measurement-NIST.lingua#r_00QNYTS0KD4Y8SCJR68K1JECFM), the entire guide; [Computing Uncertainty for Charpy Impact Machine Test Results — NIST](../sources/Charpy-Impact-Uncertainty-NIST.lingua#r_5GBY4J4HZTHJSY48TSH3RZ0MZR), the entire guide for any impact study; [Metallography and Microstructures — ASM Handbook, volume 9](../sources/ASM-Metallography-and-Microstructures.lingua#r_4XHEJ1ZHW0B1YNG9AWCEC491ME), whole applicable professional chapters, when available; [Mechanical Testing and Evaluation — ASM Handbook, volume 8](../sources/ASM-Mechanical-Testing-and-Evaluation.lingua#r_1VW327STC5YQGRAPNRAPQSZQNG), whole applicable method/evaluation chapters, when available.

Choose documented metal/alloy states with enough initial material/history information for independent interpretation. Plan a sustained study linking representative sampling, specimen preparation, bulk/local chemistry, phase/structure, spatial/orientation evidence, and mechanical or other relevant property measurements. Appropriate facilities, methods, and professional guidance support actual laboratory achievement; a supplied-data study explicitly states its scope.

Preserve specimen identity, location/orientation, preparation/history, reference materials, calibration, instrument/settings and processing definitions, repeats, uncertainty, and the original observations. Include a deliberately challenging population or state rather than only illustrative successful specimens. Explain how preparation, resolution, sampling, or signal processing could create the apparent result.

Compare at least two structural or mechanism interpretations with complementary independent observations. Reproduce quantitative phase/population, composition, stress/strain or property, and uncertainty calculations. Validate an important result on an independent specimen/condition and preserve discrepancies or failed methods.

**Work:** produce a substantial technical report with a complete primary bibliography, original methods/evidence, independently checkable calculations, competing explanations, and conclusions tied to the actual material population and question. Another reader should reproduce a central quantitative result and challenge a consequential assumption. Defend the next experiment and explain which practical preparation/measurement capabilities were actually demonstrated.

**Continue:** [Compare extraction/refining alternatives through complete chemistry, transport, and operating evidence](Advanced-pyro-hydro-and-electrochemical-process-study.lingua#r_68RRFAQE1TM4FPRKRBJESZ4NRP).

